    // R61.59 OBS REALITY + ADAPTIVE INSTRUMENTATION + STATE HYGIENE: end-to-end browser/client/media diagnostics, responsive full-player geometry, consolidated transient-surface ownership and removal of retired media-presentation persistence; playback authority remains frozen.
