    // R61.45 RESOLVER HEALTH + INSTRUMENT SURFACE: route-health memory and bounded background extractors close resolver worker leaks; premium creative-instrument micro-geometry deepens the shell without adding visual noise.
    // R61.42 SESSION SLOTS: independent resumable listening worlds snapshot playlist/Pool source, authoritative queue state, repeat/history and exact playback bookmark while every slot feeds the same global Now Playing/OBS output.
